+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use LRU (Least Recently Used) eviction for the cache layer with a fixed TTL of 300 seconds, chosen for its simpler operational model and more predictable behavior when debugging and tuning, at the cost of some absolute hit-rate optimization.
